    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjbT7Fq1OJ3_ESYvrZNAIa9LbQuJdyH6HJG8rVehILno2b2mIwASUcEr-TePKo3twSWuGYZ9j1WGz6-twgZTERw4B-ltN4XKb4g9QHkTAXVv7ovew6N8pW6_WyBqcAECP4yprU5kmIKMAka758WjWeQG4yWkCV-CwqeC0LDkTL6lkxXY5rDp3c0l6ANKg/s1421/335%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1421\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjbT7Fq1OJ3_ESYvrZNAIa9LbQuJdyH6HJG8rVehILno2b2mIwASUcEr-TePKo3twSWuGYZ9j1WGz6-twgZTERw4B-ltN4XKb4g9QHkTAXVv7ovew6N8pW6_WyBqcAECP4yprU5kmIKMAka758WjWeQG4yWkCV-CwqeC0LDkTL6lkxXY5rDp3c0l6ANKg/w450-h640/335%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEilHrli5PrWwRUQ-fd6faI8OkHBa73dUK6F5lHYjq4BcdWuSiiA7mXWX6wOP4bqwXATOT2z2qJAW4rYuwfn5ok5vzD_EGkTy7ZDnfwYkKtxE8AiOts_r8igO5d_zOaM05dWgYujHETm7MbXKpsDfjMhNBbTlxruNRpcufzU9pTh4YSc27v-XdyJ8vDv2A/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1335%E6%9C%9F_027.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEilHrli5PrWwRUQ-fd6faI8OkHBa73dUK6F5lHYjq4BcdWuSiiA7mXWX6wOP4bqwXATOT2z2qJAW4rYuwfn5ok5vzD_EGkTy7ZDnfwYkKtxE8AiOts_r8igO5d_zOaM05dWgYujHETm7MbXKpsDfjMhNBbTlxruNRpcufzU9pTh4YSc27v-XdyJ8vDv2A/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1335%E6%9C%9F_027.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">更正啟事：<span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">334期</span><b>〈《台文通訊》30冬紀念獎頒獎典禮〉</b></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #990000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">334期〈《台文通訊》30冬紀念獎頒獎典禮〉第37頁ê內容有錯誤，正確ê內容是：\n\n台羅會理事長張復聚醫生tiānn 講：lán ài趕緊來起造「台灣學」。台灣學就是kōo台灣語文來記錄、傳播、教育lán ê文化智識。\n\n編輯部tī tsia更正，mā kā tio̍h獎人吳家銘先生、台羅會理事長張復聚醫生kap讀者會失禮。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #990000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">\n--------------------------------</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #990000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">\nTio̍h獎人吳家銘先生有特別提供詳細ê逐字稿beh kap讀者分享，詳細內容請看：\nhttps://reurl.cc/128n7Y</span></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">科技運用獎</span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>吳家銘</b></span></p><div class=\"cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql o9v6fnle\" style=\"font-family: inherit; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tāi-ke平安，我是「台文雞絲麵」計e̍k發起jîn，Ngô͘ Ka-bêng。Chiok感謝「​​Tân Bûn-sêng教授紀念基金會」、「Taigi Mission Fund」決定beh頒chit-ê siúⁿ hō͘--我，對我chit 5冬ùi軟體工程師轉途全心來做台文事工，ū chiok tōa ê鼓勵。我參與ê時間bô gōa久，來領chit-ê 30冬紀念siúⁿ是ū tām-po̍h-á歹勢，m̄-koh相信án-ne ē鼓舞khah chē青少年朋友做伙投入。</span></div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: justify;\"><span><a name='more'></a></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div></div><div class=\"cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql o9v6fnle\" style=\"font-family: inherit; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tī台灣大學內底ê Tân Bûn-sêng事件紀念tiâⁿ，頂禮拜chiah tú經過校務會議決定，thang設說明牌á，hông知影chit-chân烏暗ê歷史。Beh設chit-ê tiâⁿ，chiok-chiok 10冬，中間iáu是ū烏手直直chhun--入-來。台灣ê民主運動kiâⁿ kàu taⁿ，解救lán台灣lâng寶貴ê活命，bô-ta-ôa，靈魂soah iáu bē得tio̍h tháu-pàng。</span></div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div></div><div class=\"cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql o9v6fnle\" style=\"font-family: inherit; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">台羅會理事長張復chû醫生tiāⁿ kóng：lán ài趕緊來起造「台灣學」。台灣學to̍h是kō͘台灣語文來記錄、傳播、教育lán ê文化智識。Gún「台文博覽會」團隊製作YouTube節目「台語相借問」，bat訪būn chêng文化部長Tēⁿ Lē-kun，請i用哲學來解說語言kap思想ê關係，i真認同阿勇講--ê，「語言m̄是文化ê 1-ê部份，其實文化to̍h是語言」。頂禮拜香港出名ê導演杜汶澤（dou6 man4 zaak6）先生tī面冊寫1句話——消滅1-ê民族，先消滅i ê語言。（『消滅一個民族，先消滅他的語言。』），是i做1-ê文化工作者，siōng深ê感受。台灣lâng beh精神、beh覺醒，chhím頭tio̍h ài lán ka-tī願意注重台灣語文，在來Tâi-oân族tio̍h ài實chiān「講台語、讀寫台文」，chiah ū才調thn̂g-thòaⁿ ka-tī ê文化，建立ka-tī ê思想自由，脫lī中華民國（中國）教育。</span></div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div></div><div class=\"cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql o9v6fnle\" style=\"font-family: inherit; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">我ùi 2016年年底開始，整理chē-chē寶貴ê台語字詞資料，開發PhahTaigi輸入法kap ChhoeTaigi辭典。Ǹg望利益Tâi-oân lâng來學習台語、實chiān台文書寫。應效siáⁿ款iáu bô lâng去研究，總--是ta̍k-kang tī線頂看ē tio̍h ū lâng chhiau ChhoeTaigi辭典，teh論台語詞，mā lú來lú chē lâng願意o̍h白話字，安PhahTaigi輸入法，來寫台文。Koh 1-pái感謝主辦單位頒chit-ê siúⁿ hō͘--我，ǹg望我ē-tàng像其他siăn-pái kāng款，繼續做30冬、60冬。</span></div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div></div><div class=\"cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql o9v6fnle\" style=\"font-family: inherit; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">最後分享1-chân代，我是「打狗台語開講社」chêng社長，chit-má擔任組頭。Gún chit幾冬ū針對ta̍k款族群設計in適合ê活動，來創造友善ê台語文環境——hō͘一般社會大眾ū「台文博覽會」、「台語開講會」、YouTube節目「台語相借問」；支持母語家庭ū「來聽台語gín-á古」、講師培hùn、出版台語畫本；幫chān學習者、教育者ū辦讀冊會，台文基礎班、進階班課程，認證研習等等。影響bē少lâng關心kap投入，應效相信bô輸1-ê正式ê NGO，m̄-koh kan-na靠少少幾ê有志sio-kēng，實在需要koh khah chē資源來o͘-ián。所pái我決定將chit-pái siúⁿ金全額捐hō͘「打狗台語開講社」，thang趕緊來成立「打狗台語文促進協會」。Ǹg望chit-pái捐款，ē-sái吸引其他有志tàu-tīn來sio-thīn！</span></div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div></div><div class=\"cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql o9v6fnle\" style=\"font-family: inherit; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span face=\"&quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white; color: #050505; font-size: large;\">Siōng尾，感謝chē-chē siăn-pái、有志引chhōa我kiâⁿ chit條台語路，hō͘我bē孤單。感謝「台文雞絲麵」ê贊助者，長期支持我做chia ê事工。Lán繼續phah拚，ló͘-la̍t！</span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span class=\"pq6dq46d tbxw36s4 knj5qynh kvgmc6g5 ditlmg2l oygrvhab nvdbi5me sf5mxxl7 gl3lb2sf hhz5lgdu\" face=\"&quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white; color: #050505; display: inline-flex; height: 16px; margin: 0px 1px; vertical-align: middle; width: 16px;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"></div></span></span></div></div><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #990000;\"><span data-offset-key=\"d7cji-0-0\" face=\"Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span data-text=\"true\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">感謝Ngô͘ Ka-bêng tī </span></span><span class=\"diy96o5h\" end=\"29\" face=\"Arial, sans-serif\" start=\"18\" style=\"font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">李江却台語文教基金會</span><span data-offset-key=\"d7cji-2-0\" face=\"Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span data-text=\"true\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> FB 提供全文逐字稿，</span></span><span class=\"diy96o5h\" end=\"55\" face=\"Arial, sans-serif\" start=\"45\" style=\"font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">台文通訊BONG報</span><span data-offset-key=\"d7cji-4-0\" face=\"Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span data-text=\"true\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> 編輯部tī tsia更正，mā kā 著獎人Ngô͘ Ka-bêng (</span></span><span class=\"diy96o5h\" end=\"96\" face=\"Arial, sans-serif\" start=\"92\" style=\"font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">吳家銘</span><span data-offset-key=\"d7cji-6-0\" face=\"Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span data-text=\"true\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">) kap讀者會失禮。</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><b><br /></b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi4tPNWIB_E-NFYn5VQMa-kS_2iDHxbeciPj7PGcultxZxoBG5GC-s3c4oR3wBSAf-tG4cYC4MEmEgHzb09WVoIodS6PwDLU9kg9IzQrUY8ZCyDnxHjqTQ6BDswAsq-PneSjnpch7RTON7hho-H_66XvEqyO7qtzhF8BTWWIu3-di0wCX7lOVobXVJk5Q=s1395\" style=\"font-size: medium; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em; text-align: center;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1395\" data-original-width=\"595\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi4tPNWIB_E-NFYn5VQMa-kS_2iDHxbeciPj7PGcultxZxoBG5GC-s3c4oR3wBSAf-tG4cYC4MEmEgHzb09WVoIodS6PwDLU9kg9IzQrUY8ZCyDnxHjqTQ6BDswAsq-PneSjnpch7RTON7hho-H_66XvEqyO7qtzhF8BTWWIu3-di0wCX7lOVobXVJk5Q=s16000\" /></a></span></p><p><span></span></p><!--more--><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><p></p><p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiI3mw1ahDoDNuxnWMKkOFmUbBEiuAPFvsJlKVYCVkYRuJJHKmYloprKuV6l-s7MxWUksX8X0CNqabalr_4tuX6PiD1MugQnL3sb4Xgieky58QHfyd9jpSWtMEfCrcmXqk4VgXtJHdSJmurCUYjlWuWkHZvh7loIraDeLJrivXTYWgyMjWfZVOC-1tl1w=s1424\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiI3mw1ahDoDNuxnWMKkOFmUbBEiuAPFvsJlKVYCVkYRuJJHKmYloprKuV6l-s7MxWUksX8X0CNqabalr_4tuX6PiD1MugQnL3sb4Xgieky58QHfyd9jpSWtMEfCrcmXqk4VgXtJHdSJmurCUYjlWuWkHZvh7loIraDeLJrivXTYWgyMjWfZVOC-1tl1w=w450-h640\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">-----------------------<br /><b><br /></b></span><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>台文通訊30冬紀念獎 頒獎典禮 (第一場)&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://youtu.be/d5JTY2a5-e4\" target=\"_blank\">https://youtu.be/d5JTY2a5-e4</a></b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>台文通訊30冬紀念獎 頒獎典禮 (第二場)&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://youtu.be/hpsiG5NmBy8\" target=\"_blank\">https://youtu.be/hpsiG5NmBy8</a></b><br /><br />-----------------------</span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div><br /></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div><span><b style=\"font-family: inherit;\">#</b><b>台文通訊30歲</b><b style=\"font-family: inherit;\">&nbsp;專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap傳統白話字。</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報334期，2022年1月出刊。</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><div align=\"center\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　</span></span></h3><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: large; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">（捐款可抵稅，匯款後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(定期定額) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(單筆) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</div></span><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div></span></span></h3><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #050505; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></span></div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: left;\"></span></div><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 15px;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">李江却台語文教基金會需要你ê定期捐款，逐個月捐助NT$200以上，lán做伙來推動復振台灣語文ê事工，歡迎利用劃撥、電匯、信用卡、郵局『存簿儲金自動轉帳』扣款iah是線頂捐款、現金贊助。</span><br /><span style=\"color: #999999;\"><br /></span></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: medium;\"></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">◎逐個月贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$200（iah是逐冬NT$2,400）以上，</span><span style=\"color: #999999;\">做伙支持基金會事工kap雜誌編印發行費用。歡迎利用郵局劃撥、信用卡（寫捐款單）、線頂捐款、現金贊助、銀行/ATM轉帳（轉帳了後請通知）、支票、郵局戶頭自動轉帳扣繳（寫授權書），捐款收據ē-tàng做『列舉扣除額』抵稅ê用途。</span></span></div></div></div></div><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br style=\"font-size: medium;\" /></div></div></div></div></span></div><div><br /></div><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><p></p><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div>"
